# Trivy CVE-gate exceptions for the explorer release image.
#
# The release gate (publish.yml) fails on fixable HIGH|CRITICAL findings;
# this file lists reviewed exceptions. Mirrors otel-sqlite's gate and its
# conventions: every entry carries its review note above it and is deleted
# when the base image ships the fix.
#
# CVE-2026-85091 - zlib1g (debian:trixie-slim 13.7): heap buffer overflow in
# gz_vacate(), arbitrary code execution. Reviewed 2026-11-20: the release
# binary is statically linked Go with no zlib linkage and the explorer never
# decompresses attacker-controlled data; zlib1g is present only in the base
# distro stack. Fixed upstream as 1:1.3.dfsg+really1.3.1-1+deb13u1; remove
# this entry once trixie-slim carries it.
CVE-2026-85091
